# {{ package_name }}

Generated CrateStack TypeScript client with a fetch transport{% if tanstack %} and TanStack Query hooks{% endif %}{% if rtk %} and an RTK Query endpoint set{% endif %}.

```ts
import { {{ client_class_name }} } from "{{ package_name }}";

const client = new {{ client_class_name }}("https://api.example.com");
```

The generated client uses `{{ base_path }}` as its API base path by default.

## Runtime Setup

```ts
const client = new {{ client_class_name }}("https://api.example.com", {
  basePath: "{{ base_path }}",
  headers: async () => ({
    authorization: `Bearer ${await tokenStore.getAccessToken()}`,
    "x-request-id": crypto.randomUUID(),
  }),
});
```

Per-call headers are also supported:

```ts
const headers = {
  authorization: `Bearer ${accessToken}`,
  "idempotency-key": idempotencyKey,
};
```

